<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Hello,</font></p><p data-pm-slice="1 1 []" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p dir="auto" style="color: rgb(47, 57, 65); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p><p dir="auto" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(47, 57, 65); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">We are reaching out regarding a mutual customer that is returning payments recently after funding. The customers&nbsp;</span><font color="#2f3941" face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.Payments_Collected__c}&nbsp;</font><span style="color: rgb(47, 57, 65); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">payment has been returned to us on&nbsp;</span><font color="#2f3941" face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!Case.Date_of_Bounce__c} due to&nbsp;{!Case.Returned_Payment_Type__c}</font><span style="color: rgb(47, 57, 65); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">. Please attempt to reach the customer and have them call into us to get their account resolved. If we are unable to resolve the account we may need to proceed with reclaiming the commission.</span></p><p dir="auto" style="color: rgb(47, 57, 65); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></p><p dir="auto" style="color: rgb(47, 57, 65); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you in advance for any help you can provide.</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;{!User.Title}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>